{"title":"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Finding_New_Length)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Finding New Length)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Using_Area_of_Original_Rectangle)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Using Area of Original Rectangle)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 CEMC Hypatia Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A rectangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/2/6b2d9ed4274ee10df49cde2cc19913d3d610a47a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathcal{R}_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" />, has length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/b/edb6c124e4e493c37260e6af2f2d74ee0099439d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\text { cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> and length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/0/61046bb5c3380d2eec081789de44c1f5c546992e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />. The length of the rectangle is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> and its width remains unchanged. What is the area of the resulting rectangle?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Finding_New_Length.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Finding_New_Length)\">Solution 1 (Finding New Length)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Finding New Length)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the length is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, the new length will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b05e47026d5b99c45109c68f0922bf6c136f13ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\text { cm} \\times 1.1 = 5.5 \\text { cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the new area would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/3/ee36ee379559c978610c516dcd6dcf32dd7cb76b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5.5 \\text { cm} \\times 4 \\text { cm} = \\boxed{22 \\text{ cm}^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"198\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Using_Area_of_Original_Rectangle.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Using_Area_of_Original_Rectangle)\">Solution 2 (Using Area of Original Rectangle)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Using Area of Original Rectangle)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Before the length of the rectangle is changed, the area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d298184ecc1b8f4a4883feeebec99157098091d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\text{ cm} \\times 4 \\text{ cm} = 20 \\text{ cm}^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"172\" height=\"18\" />. \n</p><p>Since the width of the rectangle isn't changed but the length of the rectangle is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, the area of the rectangle must also have been changed by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, the new area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/d/92dfb7207d7a8ed82ee82dc2921c5cbdb4d46f83.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\text{ cm}^{2} \\times 1.1 = \\boxed{22 \\text{ cm}^{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"188\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032302\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 79/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2142/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.869      1 2025_CEMC_Hypatia_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%    5.869      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36315:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018032302 and revision id 281333. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}